    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like both a bridge and a puzzle—it’s structured enough to feel empowering but can also be abstract when it doesn’t make intuitive sense. As someone who enjoys problem-solving in my free time (like hiking or puzzles), I approach math with curiosity, but sometimes its precision feels rigid compared to creative hobbies.",
