    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes! I’ve used tools like Khan Academy’s chatbot or Wolfram Alpha for quick checks on proofs or formulas. It helped bridge gaps when stuck on physics/economics concepts—especially for me since neuroticism sometimes leaves me overthinking steps—but it can’t replace deep intuition.",
